  "limits": [
    "Docker/systemd supervision supplied locally; no offhost installation or host power-loss test.",
    "Historical source generators remain source-review artifacts, not application runtime. Superseded generator intentionally refuses to overwrite the corrected matrix.",
    "Third-party installed dependency bodies are not vendored desk code; tested locked versions retained.",
    "No strategies, broker orders, model-provider calls or external notification posts.",
    "Container and final integrated validation recorded in FULL_AUDIT_REPORT after all module repairs freeze.",
    "Request deadlines are per HTTP operation, not a guarantee that an entire multi-stage operational pass finishes in one cadence interval. Slow cancelled DNS resolver work is bounded to four threads; its results cannot start later HTTP sends."
  ]
